<title>NETHERLANDS: Euro is first step to world monetary order -Jospin.</title>
<headline>Euro is first step to world monetary order -Jospin.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>French Prime Minister Lionel Jospin said on Tuesday that the launching of a single European currency could be the first stage to a necessary stable world monetary order.</p>
<p>&quot;The euro is, I think, a stage towards the reconstruction of an international monetary system worthy of that name, which I think is necessary for the stability of world economic relations,&quot; he told a news conference.</p>
</text>
